{"sections":[{"slug":"酉群的三选二性质","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"酉群的三选二性质"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">酉群的三选二性质</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“酉群的三选二性质”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unitary_group#2-out-of-3_property\" title=\"Wikipedia 页面 [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unitary_group#2-out-of-3_property]\">Wikipedia <span lang=\"zh\">页面</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">酉群</span> $U_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是三个群</span> $O_{2n}$, $GL_n(\\mathbb{C})$, $Sp_{2n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的交</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且等于其中任意两个的交</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这意味着</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">复结构和辛结构中任意两者</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">只要满足相容性</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">即可导出第三者</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}